 * `v_wind_z_in` - This connector represents a real signal as an input to a component ([`RealInput`](@ref))

## Variables

| Name         | Description                         | Units  | 
| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ |
| `T`         | Static air temperature                         | K  |
